@startuml
title Embedded audio: place a video, hear it, detach its sound

actor User
participant TimelineView
participant TimelineEditor
participant CommandHistory
participant AudioMixer
participant ProjectStore
participant EmbeddedAudioMigration as Migration

== open an older project ==
ProjectStore -> Migration : Migrate(project)  (FormatVersion < 1)
Migration -> Migration : each VideoClip + linked AudioClip, same source and timing:\nremove the AudioClip, VideoClip.PlaysAudio = true,\nkeep its volume, fades (as the sound fades),\nvolume keyframes and markers
Migration -> Migration : drop audio tracks left empty; FormatVersion = 1

== place a video with sound ==
User -> TimelineView : drop the file
TimelineView -> TimelineEditor : AddMedia(asset, track, t)
TimelineEditor -> TimelineEditor : CreateClipFromAsset: VideoClip, PlaysAudio = asset.HasAudio
TimelineEditor --> TimelineView : TimelineChanged
TimelineView -> TimelineView : picture, with the waveform strip under it

== playback / export ==
AudioMixer -> AudioMixer : for each track (audio: AudioClips, video: VideoClips that PlaysAudio)\nsource range, speed, volume x fades -> mixed into the buffer

== fade the sound alone ==
User -> TimelineView : drag a fade handle on the sound strip
TimelineView -> TimelineView : EdgeAt -> FadeIn, FadeOf.Sound
TimelineView -> TimelineEditor : SetFadeIn(clip, sec, FadeOf.Sound)
TimelineEditor -> CommandHistory : ExecuteCoalescing(SetFadeInCommand(of = Sound))
note right: AudioFadeInSec changes; the picture's FadeInSec does not

== detach ==
User -> TimelineView : right-click the clip -> Detach audio
TimelineView -> TimelineEditor : DetachAudio(selected video clips)
TimelineEditor -> TimelineEditor : AudioClip copying the source range, speed,\nvolume, sound fades and volume keyframes; a free audio track
TimelineEditor -> CommandHistory : Execute(Composite: PlaysAudio = false, [add track], AddClip)
note right: one undo step; the new clip is not linked,\nso it moves and trims on its own
TimelineEditor --> TimelineView : TimelineChanged (strip gone, audio clip below)
@enduml
